# SPA fallback: this is a client-side-routed React app (BrowserRouter), so paths
# like /dashboard, /sales-orders, etc. only exist in the browser router, not as
# files on Netlify. Without this rule a hard reload or a shared deep link 404s.
# Serve index.html for every path and let React Router resolve it. 200, not 302,
# so the URL in the address bar is preserved.
/*    /index.html   200
